## Proposed Changes

### Portal (Next.js) — `apps/portal`

#### [MODIFY] `apps/portal/src/app/settings/page.tsx` (or equivalent settings route)
- Add a **"Location"** settings card (owner-only, same pattern as existing cards)
  - Toggle: **Require location for check-in** (`requireLocation`)
  - Number input: **Fence radius (metres)** — 10–5000
  - Lat / Lng inputs + **"Use my browser location"** button (Geolocation API) + **"Open in Google Maps"** verify link
