### Flutter Mobile App

#### [MODIFY] [pubspec.yaml](file:///c:/Users/PC/Downloads/restuarant_attendence/apps/mobile/pubspec.yaml)
- Add `geolocator: ^13.0.2` dependency

#### Android permissions — `apps/mobile/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`
- Add `ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION`, `ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION`
- Note: `ACCESS_BACKGROUND_LOCATION` is **NOT** needed — we only capture GPS at the moment the button is pressed

#### iOS permissions — `apps/mobile/ios/Runner/Info.plist`
- Add `NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription`

#### [NEW] `apps/mobile/lib/services/location_service.dart`
- `LocationService.capture()` → returns `GpsCapture` (lat, lng, accuracy, isMock, timestampMs)
- Handles permission request flow
- Throws typed `LocationException` subtypes: `LocationPermissionDenied`, `LocationServiceDisabled`, `LocationAccuracyTooLow`
- Accuracy threshold: 150 m (matches server validation)

#### [MODIFY] [models.dart](file:///c:/Users/PC/Downloads/restuarant_attendence/apps/mobile/lib/models/models.dart)
- Add `requireLocation`, `locationLat?`, `locationLng?`, `locationRadiusMeters` fields to `Restaurant`
- Parse from `settings` map in `fromSnapshot`

#### [MODIFY] [attendance_service.dart](file:///c:/Users/PC/Downloads/restuarant_attendence/apps/mobile/lib/services/attendance_service.dart)
- Add `gpsCoords` parameter (optional `GpsCapture`) to `recordManual` and `recordFace`
- Serialize and send in callable payload only when non-null

#### [MODIFY] [home_screen.dart](file:///c:/Users/PC/Downloads/restuarant_attendence/apps/mobile/lib/screens/home_screen.dart)
- In `_manual()`: before calling `service.recordManual`, if `restaurant.requireLocation`, call `LocationService.capture()` and pass result; show user-friendly error if location fails
- Face check-in already goes through `face_capture_screen.dart` → also passes GPS there

#### [MODIFY] `apps/mobile/lib/screens/face_capture_screen.dart`
- Capture GPS at the moment the shutter is pressed, pass to `attendance_service.recordFace`

#### [MODIFY] [reason_codes.dart](file:///c:/Users/PC/Downloads/restuarant_attendence/apps/mobile/lib/models/reason_codes.dart)
- Add constants and messages for `LOCATION_REQUIRED`, `LOCATION_OUT_OF_RANGE`, `LOCATION_MOCK`, `LOCATION_ACCURACY_LOW`, `LOCATION_STALE`
- `LOCATION_REQUIRED` and `LOCATION_OUT_OF_RANGE` are non-retryable

