## Part 2 — Firebase App Distribution Guide

This will be produced as a `FIREBASE_DISTRIBUTION.md` guide after the code changes. It will cover:

1. Enabling App Distribution in the Firebase console
2. Building a signed APK/AAB: `flutter build apk --release`
3. Uploading via Firebase CLI: `firebase appdistribution:distribute ...`
4. Creating tester groups and sending invitation emails
5. Testers installing via **Firebase App Tester** app

> [!NOTE]
> Firebase App Distribution is free and requires only a Firebase project (no Blaze plan needed for distribution itself, though Cloud Functions still requires Blaze).
